    <li>Windows 64-bit Installer: <a href="http://downloads.xiph.org/releases/oggdsf/oggcodecs_0.82.16930-x64.exe">oggcodecs_0.82.16930-x64.exe</a> 1,30MB</li>
</ul>
<p>For more informations see the <a href="/dshow/downloads/">Downloads</a> page.
</p>


